      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like everything i thought was real just... evaporated. i spent my whole life building this version of the world, believing in these certainties, and now it's just gone. like there's no floor anymore. just this massive, empty space where my purpose used to be. it feels like i'm just drifting in nothingness.",
