      "content": "it's more than just uncertainty though. it feels wrong. like, if the foundation was a lie, then everything i did, every choice i made, was based on a hallucination. how am i even supposed to exist in a world that doesn't actually have any meaning or structure? it's like i'm staring into a void that's just... permanent.",
